  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The four Companions are now on their way back to Jorrvaskr from Riften.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869967
    - rid: 4972360430703869970
    - rid: 4972360430703869972
    - rid: 4972360430703869965
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869973
    - rid: 4972360430703869974
    - rid: 4972360430703870090
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They successfully brought the Valmir matter to the attention of Jarl
      Laila Law-Giver...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But, after a brief debate in the court-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It was determined that there was no current recourse to punish the Thalmor;
      not during the civil war.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Though, the Stormcloak-friendly regime of Riften was quick to express
      desires for... radical retribution.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870036
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870037
